{"3432120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hiding", "steam_appid": 3432120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every 20 seconds, the rules change:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First phase:</strong> Enemies go invisible. You can’t see them, but you’ll hear every footstep, reload, and whisper. Time to loot up and prepare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Second phase:</strong> Everyone’s visible. It’s showtime — lock, load, and light up the battlefield!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your mission</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect crystals, open the portal, and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or… stay, fight, and dominate for bigger rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432120/extras/2889f594fa027fce0c9c876a2cb08abd.webp?t=1762266884\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432120/extras/2889f594fa027fce0c9c876a2cb08abd.poster.avif?t=1762266884\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic 20-Second Phases</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth mode for looting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat mode for pure chaos</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Ammo Worries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons auto-reload — you focus on killing, not counting bullets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >10 Gritty Urban Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From decaying warehouses to bass-thumping underground clubs:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full of cover, ambush spots, and deadly traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for fast movement and intense close combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"